{"id":"65f79fdc4c47ee8b","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-pcp-list-complement-dcfl.md","title":"列表语言的补是确定性上下文无关语言","display":"thm-pcp-list-complement-dcfl — 列表语言的补是确定性上下文无关语言","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-pcp-list-complement-dcfl","aliases":["73-thm-pcp-list-complement-dcfl"],"display":"thm-pcp-list-complement-dcfl — 列表语言的补是确定性上下文无关语言","depends_on":["[[73-df-pcp-list-grammars]]","[[73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§9.5.3, Theorem 9.21, print p. 416; PDF p. 438","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":9},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-pcp-list-complement-dcfl"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-pcp-list-complement-dcfl</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pcp-list-complement-dcfl — 列表语言的补是确定性上下文无关语言"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"76b8cfaf4d1fb58a\" href=\"?note=76b8cfaf4d1fb58a\" title=\"73-df-pcp-list-grammars\">73-df-pcp-list-grammars</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e63e7d14efa1e2c3\" href=\"?note=e63e7d14efa1e2c3\" title=\"73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton\">73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§9.5.3, Theorem 9.21, print p. 416; PDF p. 438"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"9"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,T,G_A(I),G_B(I)\">\\(I,T,G_A(I),G_B(I)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"76b8cfaf4d1fb58a\" href=\"?note=76b8cfaf4d1fb58a\" title=\"73-df-pcp-list-grammars\">73-df-pcp-list-grammars</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DCFL}_T\">\\(\\mathsf{DCFL}_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e63e7d14efa1e2c3\" href=\"?note=e63e7d14efa1e2c3\" title=\"73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton\">73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton</a> 的终态接受版本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T^*\\setminus L(G_A(I))\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_T,\\qquad\nT^*\\setminus L(G_B(I))\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T^*\\setminus L(G_A(I))\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_T,\\qquad\nT^*\\setminus L(G_B(I))\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>确定 PDA 先把二进制前缀压栈；读到索引 aᵢ 时，有限控制按 uᵢ 的逆序逐项核对并弹栈。已经匹配而栈仍非空的输入前缀应接受其补；恰清空且索引尾部正确时不接受；顺序错误、符号不匹配或清空后又有输入则进入接受陷阱。不能把“到达输入结尾”当作普通 PDA 可直接测试的转移动作，接受资格仍由余词为空判定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-pcp-list-grammars","status":"resolved","id":"76b8cfaf4d1fb58a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pcp-list-grammars]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton","status":"resolved","id":"e63e7d14efa1e2c3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-pcp-list-grammars","status":"resolved","id":"76b8cfaf4d1fb58a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I,T,G_A(I),G_B(I)$ 采用 [[73-df-pcp-list-grammars]]；$\\mathsf{DCFL}_T$ 采用 [[73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton]] 的终态接受版本。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton","status":"resolved","id":"e63e7d14efa1e2c3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I,T,G_A(I),G_B(I)$ 采用 [[73-df-pcp-list-grammars]]；$\\mathsf{DCFL}_T$ 采用 [[73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton]] 的终态接受版本。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"I,T,G_A(I),G_B(I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{DCFL}_T","display":false},{"tex":"T^*\\setminus L(G_A(I))\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_T,\\qquad\nT^*\\setminus L(G_B(I))\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_T.","display":true}],"bytes":1513,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-230","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-pcp-list-complement-dcfl|列表语言的补是确定性上下文无关语言]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"378dfa121b0216f8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["76b8cfaf4d1fb58a","e63e7d14efa1e2c3"]}